        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties is delighted to present this superb 3 bedroom semi-detached home, c. 108 sqm / c.1162sqt,  in this popular estate, located in the centre of town , within walking distance of all local amenities.  The property has been very well maintained by its current owners and  is very well laid out internally, with a great front sitting room, family room/office, guest wc,  utility room with a back door leading to  garden area, an open plan layout kitchen/dining room & the dining area having patio doors to the rear garden. Upstairs there are 3 great bedrooms, with the main bedroom being en-suite. \r\n\r\nEdenderry is a superb town with a full range of all services available, including a selection of primary & secondary schools, shops, restaurants, sports & activity clubs, all at your doorstep. Dublin is very easily accessible with the M4 Junction 9 within 20 minutes.\r\nViewing highly recommended. By strict appointment only with Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nHallway: Wooden floor, alarm point\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: Tiles, recessed lighting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splashed back area, stainless steel sink, under counter integrated fridge under counter integrated freezer, \r\noven, hob, extractor fan, double door leading to garden\r\n\r\nUtility Room: Tiles, light fitting, tiled splash back area, plumber for washing machine, back door leading to  garden area\r\n\r\nGuest WC: Wooden  floor, tiled surround, WHB, WC, extractor fan\r\n\r\nSitting Room: Wooden floor, fireplace\r\n\r\nFamily Room/Office:  Wooden floor\r\n\r\nBathroom: Bath, shower over bath, tiled from floor to ceiling, WHB, WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring, fitted wardrobe, blinds\r\n\r\nEnsuite: Shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor,  tiled surround\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom3: Wooden flooring, fitted wardrobe, curtains\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nFully alarmed\r\nPVC hall door\r\nCarpets, curtains and light fittings included\r\nAttic access, stira stairs, partial flooring\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nExternal water softener\r\nOutside tap\r\nOutside light\r\nOutside electric socket\r\nPatio area to rear \r\nBarna Shed\r\nSide Gate\r\nLocated in a cul de sac\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nMains water\r\nMains sewage\r\nBuilt in 2004\r\nc.108 sqm / c.1162 sqft\r\n\r\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is \r\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. \t\r\n\r\nLicence No:001492\r\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the \r\nunderstanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is \r\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do \r\nnot hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. \t\r\n\r\nLicence No:001492"
